{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-color-pipeline","title":"数字成像色彩流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory/digital-color-pipeline","wordCount":1499,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"数字成像色彩流水线\">数字成像色彩流水线</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>从光子击中传感器到像素在屏幕上发光——数字色彩经历了一条复杂的&quot;流水线&quot;（Color Pipeline）。每个环节都涉及色彩空间转换、量化策略和信息取舍。理解这条流水线，是理解&quot;为什么我的照片颜色和现场不一样&quot;的根本答案，也是优化工作流以最大化保留色彩信息的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Scene Light&lt;br/&gt;场景光&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Sensor&lt;br/&gt;传感器&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;RAW Data&lt;br/&gt;原始数据&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Demosaic&lt;br/&gt;去马赛克&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Camera RGB&lt;br/&gt;相机RGB&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;Color Matrix&lt;br/&gt;色彩矩阵&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; G[&quot;Working Space&lt;br/&gt;工作色彩空间&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;Tone Curve&lt;br/&gt;色调曲线&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;Output Transform&lt;br/&gt;输出转换&quot;]&#10;    I --&gt; J[&quot;Display&lt;br/&gt;显示器&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Scene Light&lt;br/&gt;场景光\"] --&gt; B[\"Sensor&lt;br/&gt;传感器\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"RAW Data&lt;br/&gt;原始数据\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Demosaic&lt;br/&gt;去马赛克\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Camera RGB&lt;br/&gt;相机RGB\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"Color Matrix&lt;br/&gt;色彩矩阵\"]\n    F --&gt; G[\"Working Space&lt;br/&gt;工作色彩空间\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"Tone Curve&lt;br/&gt;色调曲线\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"Output Transform&lt;br/&gt;输出转换\"]\n    I --&gt; J[\"Display&lt;br/&gt;显示器\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数字色彩流水线的本质，是一连串&quot;信息转换与取舍&quot;的决策链：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RAW 是信息量最大的起点</strong>：线性响应、厂商特定、尚未应用白平衡与色彩空间，为后续所有处理保留了最大选择空间。</li>\n<li><strong>去马赛克是不可避免的推断</strong>：Bayer 阵列每像素只感知一种颜色（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R:G:B = 1:2:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），全彩靠插值恢复，因此天然存在伪彩与摩尔纹风险。</li>\n<li><strong>色彩矩阵完成&quot;翻译&quot;</strong>：相机的光谱响应各不相同，需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\times3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵把相机 RGB 映射到标准色彩空间，DNG 双光源模型进一步适配不同色温。</li>\n<li><strong>核心原则是推迟不可逆决策</strong>：每一步都尽量保留选择，把色域、位深、色调映射等不可逆转换留到最后一刻，以匹配最终输出目标。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"传感器到-raw\">传感器到 RAW</h2><h3 id=\"bayer-滤色阵列\">Bayer 滤色阵列</h3><p>绝大多数数字相机传感器的每个像素只能感知一种颜色——通过覆盖 Bayer 滤色阵列（RGGB 模式）实现色彩采集：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Bayer 比例</mtext><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>G</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Bayer 比例}: R : G : B = 1 : 2 : 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Bayer </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">比例</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>绿色 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>人眼对绿色亮度最敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每像素单色</td>\n<td>其余两色靠插值推算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RAW 文件</td>\n<td>存储未插值的单色数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>位深</td>\n<td>通常 12-bit 或 14-bit</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"raw-数据特性\">RAW 数据特性</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>RAW 属性</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性响应</td>\n<td>光子数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>∝</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\propto</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span></span></span></span></span> 数值（无 gamma）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>厂商特定</td>\n<td>各品牌RAW格式不同（CR3/NEF/ARW）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无白平衡</td>\n<td>WB 作为元数据，未应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无色彩空间</td>\n<td>尚未分配标准色彩空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大信息</td>\n<td>所有后续处理的最佳起点</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"去马赛克-demosaicing\">去马赛克（Demosaicing）</h2><h3 id=\"算法类型\">算法类型</h3><p>去马赛克是从 Bayer 格栅的单色像素推算出全彩 RGB 的过程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>单色像素</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>插值算法</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>全彩 RGB 像素</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{单色像素} \\xrightarrow{\\text{插值算法}} \\text{全彩 RGB 像素}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1113em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">单色像素</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1003em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">插值算法</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">全彩</span><span class=\"mord\"> RGB </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">像素</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>质量</th>\n<th>速度</th>\n<th>伪影风险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>双线性插值</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n<td>高（摩尔纹）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VNG (Variable Number of Gradients)</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>快</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AHD (Adaptive Homogeneity-Directed)</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DCB</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AMaZE</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>慢</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AI 超分辨率去马赛克</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>慢（GPU）</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"伪彩与摩尔纹\">伪彩与摩尔纹</h3><p>当场景细节频率接近像素频率时，Bayer 插值会产生伪色（False Color）和摩尔纹（Moiré）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>scene</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>Nyquist</mtext></msub><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mtext>pixel pitch</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f_{\\text{scene}} \\geq \\frac{f_{\\text{Nyquist}}}{2} = \\frac{1}{2 \\times \\text{pixel pitch}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">scene</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Nyquist</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">pixel pitch</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"色彩矩阵与色彩特性\">色彩矩阵与色彩特性</h2><h3 id=\"相机色彩特性-camera-profile\">相机色彩特性（Camera Profile）</h3><p>每个相机传感器对光谱的响应曲线都不同——需要一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3 \\times 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 色彩矩阵将相机 RGB 转换到标准色彩空间：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo f