ow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{M}_{\\text{interpolated}} = w \\cdot \\mathbf{M}_{A} + (1-w) \\cdot \\mathbf{M}_{D65}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9722em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">interpolated</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8361em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8361em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">65</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 是基于当前白平衡色温的插值权重。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作色彩空间\">工作色彩空间</h2><h3 id=\"主流工作空间对比\">主流工作空间对比</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Working Spaces&lt;br/&gt;工作空间选择&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;sRGB&lt;br/&gt;最小色域&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;Adobe RGB&lt;br/&gt;中等色域&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;ProPhoto RGB&lt;br/&gt;超宽色域&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;DCI-P3&lt;br/&gt;电影标准&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; F[&quot;ACEScg&lt;br/&gt;场景线性&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Working Spaces&lt;br/&gt;工作空间选择\"] --&gt; B[\"sRGB&lt;br/&gt;最小色域\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"Adobe RGB&lt;br/&gt;中等色域\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"ProPhoto RGB&lt;br/&gt;超宽色域\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"DCI-P3&lt;br/&gt;电影标准\"]\n    A --&gt; F[\"ACEScg&lt;br/&gt;场景线性\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>色彩空间</th>\n<th>色域覆盖 (CIE xy)</th>\n<th>Gamma</th>\n<th>适用工作流</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>sRGB</td>\n<td>最小 (~35% CIE)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 2.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>网页/社交媒体终输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Adobe RGB</td>\n<td>中等 (~50% CIE)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>印刷工作流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DCI-P3</td>\n<td>较大 (~54% CIE)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.6</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>电影/HDR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ProPhoto RGB</td>\n<td>很大 (~90% CIE)</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.8</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>RAW 编辑中间空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rec.2020</td>\n<td>极大 (~76% CIE)</td>\n<td>PQ/HLG</td>\n<td>4K/8K HDR 视频</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ACEScg</td>\n<td>全色域</td>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>VFX/电影制作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"色域外剪切-gamut-clipping\">色域外剪切（Gamut Clipping）</h3><p>当从大色域转换到小色域时，超出范围的颜色需要处理：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>感知映射</td>\n<td>压缩全部色域，保持关系</td>\n<td>整体变淡但关系正确</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>相对色度</td>\n<td>保留域内颜色，裁剪域外</td>\n<td>域内精确，域外信息丢失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>绝对色度</td>\n<td>保持绝对值，不补偿白点</td>\n<td>用于打样</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>饱和度</td>\n<td>保持饱和度优先</td>\n<td>商标色/纯色印刷</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"色调曲线与输出\">色调曲线与输出</h2><h3 id=\"tone-mapping-的必要性\">Tone Mapping 的必要性</h3><p>场景动态范围（可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">20+</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord\">+</span></span></span></span></span> 档）远超输出设备能力（SDR 约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mtext>–</mtext><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6–8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6–8</span></span></span></span></span> 档），色调映射将场景线性数据压缩到可显示范围：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>display</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>T</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>scene</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>T</mi><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{\\text{display}} = T(L_{\\text{scene}}), \\quad T: [0, \\infty) \\rightarrow [0, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">display</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">scene</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∞</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>色调曲线类型</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>S 曲线</td>\n<td>压暗亮高光、提暗部</td>\n<td>胶片模拟、通用照片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td>无压缩</td>\n<td>HDR中间处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Log</td>\n<td>压缩高光、展开暗部</td>\n<td>视频 LOG 拍摄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ACES Filmic</td>\n<td>电影质感 S 曲线</td>\n<td>影视制作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PQ (ST 2084)</td>\n<td>HDR 绝对亮度</td>\n<td>HDR 显示</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"最终输出转换\">最终输出转换</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>输出目标</th>\n<th>色彩空间</th>\n<th>Gamma/EOTF</th>\n<th>位深</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网页/社交</td>\n<td>sRGB</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\approx 2.2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.2</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>8-bit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>打印</td>\n<td>Adobe RGB → CMYK</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>8/16-bit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HDR 视频</td>\n<td>Rec.2020 + PQ</td>\n<td>PQ ST.2084</td>\n<td>10-bit</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>电影 DCP</td>\n<td>DCI-P3</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.6</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>12-bit</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>数字色彩流水线的每一步都是信息的<strong>转换和取舍</strong>——从最大信息量的 RAW 开始，逐步适配到特定输出条件。专业工作流的目标是：<strong>在每一步保留最多选择，将不可逆的决策推迟到最后一刻</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>流水线阶段</th>\n<th>关键决策</th>\n<th>最佳实践</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>拍摄</td>\n<td>RAW vs JPEG</td>\n<td>始终RAW（保留最多信息）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>去马赛克</td>\n<td>算法选择</td>\n<td>使用高质量算法</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色彩空间</td>\n<td>工作空间选择</td>\n<td>ProPhoto 或 ACEScg</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>色调映射</td>\n<td>曲线形状</td>\n<td>匹配输出目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出</td>\n<td>最终色域/位深</td>\n<td>适配显示/打印设备</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"数字成像色彩流水线","id":"数字成像色彩流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"传感器到 RAW","id":"传感器到-raw"},{"level":3,"text":"Bayer 滤色阵列","id":"bayer-滤色阵列"},{"level":3,"text":"RAW 数据特性","id":"raw-数据特性"},{"level":2,"text":"去马赛克（Demosaicing）","id":"去马赛克-demosaicing"},{"level":3,"text":"算法类型","id":"算法类型"},{"level":3,"text":"伪彩与摩尔纹","id":"伪彩与摩尔纹"},{"level":2,"text":"色彩矩阵与色彩特性","id":"色彩矩阵与色彩特性"},{"level":3,"text":"相机色彩特性（Camera Profile）","id":"相机色彩特性-camera-profile"},{"level":3,"text":"DNG 双光源模型","id":"dng-双光源模型"},{"level":2,"text":"工作色彩空间","id":"工作色彩空间"},{"level":3,"text":"主流工作空间对比","id":"主流工作空间对比"},{"level":3,"text":"色域外剪切（Gamut Clipping）","id":"色域外剪切-gamut-clipping"},{"level":2,"text":"色调曲线与输出","id":"色调曲线与输出"},{"level":3,"text":"Tone Mapping 的必要性","id":"tone-mapping-的必要性"},{"level":3,"text":"最终输出转换","id":"最终输出转换"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"色轮与色彩和谐","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/color-theory/color-wheel-harmony"},"next":{"title":"色彩空间与色域","url":"/l-doc-books/h/photography-video/color-science/color-management/color-spaces-gamut"}}